  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are able to slay your spirit’s foes with a single strike.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Furious Strike†, Life-Stealing Strike†, base attack bonus +10, bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While you are bound to a spirit, you can make a killing blow against a creature that qualifies as that spirit’s favored enemy as a full-round action. Make a single attack at your highest attack bonus against the creature. If you hit, you deal your normal weapon damage and the creature must make a Fortitude saving throw or die (DC equals 10 + 1/2 your binder level + your Charisma modifier). Ranged attacks can only be used with this feat if the target is within 30 feet. You may attempt a foe-reaping strike once per day, plus one additional time each day when your base attack bonus reaches +4 and every 4 points thereafter.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
